{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376804 1113 #uuid "1d9f52f9-4b10-555c-b78f-ffcc8756275c" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376804 1145 "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=7y-13x+87$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=7y-13x+87$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/ffa57d3e7fed08212f12d4b9d7c2e0a4d33a3aac71c8b8a03d1a9a7364484deb.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom right corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/c4aa9e96fe72a8fb31ab62ff7eb0695cc64992bb9433be516461915a5c92baff.png)\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j-1})=7{y}_{j-1}-13{x}_{i}+87\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(7{y}_{j-1}-13{x}_{i}+87)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $7{y}_{j-1}-13{x}_{i}+87.$" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376806 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376807 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376808 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376809 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376810 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1041 "selection" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1104 #edb/ref 17592186376810 13194139535961 true] [17592186376805 1110 #uuid "d123f5c2-2bc6-57ca-8a32-add52ec34b90" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376806 1034 "7{y}_{j-1}-13{x}_{i-1}+87" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376806 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535961 true] [17592186376806 1111 #uuid "2973e618-fcd1-5c86-a7d9-babbcac47de8" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376807 1034 "6{y}_{j-1}+3{x}_{i}" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376807 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535961 true] [17592186376807 1111 #uuid "504fd308-fdf5-583c-952a-c2d5b56b6e9f" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376808 1034 "7{y}_{j}-13{x}_{i-1}+87" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376808 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535961 true] [17592186376808 1111 #uuid "7ac83690-b246-559c-aefa-a1ef2a38a33b" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376809 1034 "6{y}_{j}+3{x}_{i-1}" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376809 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535961 true] [17592186376809 1111 #uuid "eedde51a-2c2d-53ca-98c7-f035caa643a0" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376810 1034 "7{y}_{j-1}-13{x}_{i}+87" 13194139535961 true] [17592186376810 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535961 true] [17592186376810 1111 #uuid "cc8b499b-351f-5553-b55f-f9bd9de72050" 13194139535961 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-123513" 17592186376720 "q-123513/selection" 17592186376721 "q-123513/selection/01bd99034523c6f0bffffc2223ea2a0453409ded9a203010546b286e9c9edac2" 17592186376722 "q-123513/selection/4fc1b8f732c1e2b84d22ede4cdbf823c4c8f423ca426b15